{
  "description": "Settlement payout vectors shared by the market contract (contracts/shared/src/payout.rs) and the backend (backend/src/lib/payout.ts). Pools are settlement-time totals and include the bettor's stake. payout = floor(stake * (total - floor(total * fee_bp / 10000)) / winning_pool), or 0 when winning_pool is 0. fee = floor(total * fee_bp / 10000). Amounts are strings because they can exceed 2^53. Regenerate expected values only from an intentional formula change.",
